vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit TACOTS Feedback
  
  Submits a combined student-and-parent feedback form for the TACOTS scholarship programme. The form captures the student's experience of the scholarship support alongside the parent/guardian's assessment of the programme's impact on the family.
  
  On success, the feedback record is stored in the database. The endpoint returns the newly created feedback object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`application/json`)
  
  ### Student Section
  
  | Field                          | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                          |
  |--------------------------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentFirstName               | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                        |
  | studentSurname                 | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                        |
  | currentSchool                  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                                                        |
  | currentClass                   | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 4`, `PRIMARY 5`, `PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`, `JSS2`, `JSS3`, `SS1`, `SS2`, `SS3`                                                           |
  | scholarshipHelpedStay          | string | Yes      | One of: `YES - VERY MUCH`, `YES - SOMEWHAT`, `NOT SURE`, `NO`                                                                                         |
  | mostHelpfulSupport             | array  | No       | Array of: `TUITION SUPPORT`, `BOOKS AND LEARNING MATERIALS`, `SCHOOL SUPPLIES`, `MENTORSHIP`, `ENCOURAGEMENT AND GUIDANCE` (optional)                 |
  | studyMotivationRating          | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                               |
  | mentorshipImpactRating         | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`                                                                                                                               |
  | currentChallenges              | array  | No       | Array of: `DIFFICULTY UNDERSTANDING SUBJECTS`, `FINANCIAL CHALLENGES`, `LACK OF MATERIALS`, `TRANSPORTATION`, `FAMILY RESPONSIBILITIES`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  | likedMost                      | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                                                    |
  | studentImprovementSuggestions  | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                                                                    |
  
  ### Parent / Guardian Section
  
  | Field                        | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                             |
  |------------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | parentGuardianName           | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                           |
  | parentGuardianRelationship   | string | Yes      | One of: `FATHER`, `MOTHER`, `GUARDIAN`, `RELATIVE`                                                       |
  | parentPhone                  | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                    |
  | scholarshipReducedBurden     | string | Yes      | One of: `YES - SIGNIFICANTLY`, `YES - SOMEWHAT`, `NOT REALLY`, `NOT SURE`                               |
  | academicImprovementNoticed   | string | No       | One of: `YES - SIGNIFICANT`, `YES - SOME`, `NO NOTICEABLE CHANGE`, `NOT SURE` (optional)                |
  | attitudeChangeNoticed        | string | No       | One of: `YES - VERY POSITIVE`, `SOME IMPROVEMENT`, `NO CHANGE`, `NOT SURE` (optional)                   |
  | parentSatisfactionRating     | number | No       | Integer from `1` to `5` (optional)                                                                       |
  | programImpactOnFamily        | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                       |
  | parentImprovementSuggestions | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                       |
  | additionalComments           | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                       |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created TACOTS feedback record.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `404 Not Found`             | No recommended TACOTS beneficiary matches the provided `studentSurname`. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                              |
}
